############################# # Exercise Group Introduction #############################
BEGIN_PGML On Earth, if you throw a baseball straight up at speed [`v`] (in feet per second), the highest that it reaches is [`v^2/64+6`] feet above the ground.
END_PGML
###### # Body ######
BEGIN_PGML If thrown straight up with speed [`[$v]`] feet per second, how high will the baseball reach?
